#Atom_button<[
Базис:
  Marketplace `<x-ui.atoms.button>` — reference implementation (variants primary/secondary/flat/soft/black/inverse; sizes lg/md/sm/xs).
  Work Graph backlog UI дублирует ad-hoc кнопки в inline HTML.
Вектор:
  Props: type, href, variant, size, loading, circle, disabled.
  Variants: primary | secondary | flat | soft | black | inverse.
  Sizes: lg | md | sm | xs.
  A11y: aria-busy при loading; aria-disabled для link-as-button.
Цель:
  Единый контракт кнопки для Blade (Marketplace) и vanilla render (Work Graph).

Проверки:
  props parity с marketplace button.blade.php
  /dev/ui-kit показывает primary/secondary/flat

Метки:
  atom.profile: ui_component
  ui.layer: atom
  ui.id: button
  ui.marketplace.blade: resources/views/components/ui/atoms/button.blade.php
  ui.workgraph.module: src/ui/atoms/button.mjs
  trace.status: verified
]>
